# Permanent redirects for retired public URLs. Served at the Cloudflare edge as real 301s,
# ahead of any static file at the same path.
#
# NEVER delete a line: search engines, bookmarks, and old backlinks keep requesting these URLs
# for years. Point each one straight at the closest equivalent tool (never a generic page), with
# the trailing slash so there is no second hop. `npm run test:urls` enforces this after a build.
# Both slash forms are listed explicitly so neither depends on path normalization.

